#. y1:english="Kazuma-san!\nKazuma-san!\nOh,{PA:10} Tamura and Aoki.{PA:20}||Finally reunited.\nYes.{PA:20}||...He told me everything.\nKazuma-san,{PA:10}||this must be the \"favour\" that you were\ngoing to return to me||that you mentioned before.\nYeah.{PA:20} You must be{PA:10} very happy that{PA:20}||Tamura is alive.\nYes.{PA:20} Thanks to you, Kazuma-san,{PA:10}||I got to see Tamura-san...\nNow I can get plenty of||information from him again.{PA:20}\nAnd I'll never run short of tips||for the news, for a while.\nDon't get too excited.\n...If you write too much,{PA:10}||you'll end up in Tokyo Bay.\nYeah,{PA:20} he's right.||It's not a laughing matter.\nYes.{PA:10} I'll be careful!{PA:10}||Thank you very much!"
