#. y1:english="What's up?\nWell,{PA:10} you see, I'm a writer.{PA:20}||My first book did pretty well,\nbut 10 years have passed...{PA:20}\nand I haven't written a single story since.||That's why I ended up living here.\nI wish I had something to inspire me...\nGive him something?\n\nHmmm.{PA:10}||Not bad, but nothing springs to mind...\n(I have nothing to give him...)\nI wish I had something to inspire me...\nYou gave him||the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Lady with Onion{CR:00}\".\nLook at this!!!{MS:0}{PA:20}||Hmmm... Ideas are popping into my head!\nYes, this is good!!{PA:10}||Here.\nTake this as a token of my appreciation.\nYou got the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Book by a Struggling Writer{CR:00}\".\nThank you!{PA:10} I owe you one!{PA:10}||Will you please give this book\nto the artist who painted this?\nYou gained 500 exp.\n\n2 years later,{PA:10} the man wrote a bestseller,||titled \"Onion Lady\".\n"
