#. y1:english="What are you doing,{PA:10} {MS:0}old man?\nHmm? {MS:0}{PA:10}Are you...{PA:10} Yakuza?\nSomething like that.\nThat's what I thought.{PA:20}{MS:0}||{MS:1}Such a waste...\nJudging by your mannerisms and eyes...\nYou have the capacity to be the strongest||man in the world, {PA:10}with the proper training.\nHowever,{PA:10} talking to a Yakuza is like||{MS:0}talking to a brick wall.\nIf you keep your abilities hidden,{PA:10}||you may end up dying in a street fight...\n...Oh,{PA:10} {PA:10}{MS:0}I was only talking to myself.{PA:20}||Don't mind me.\nNo, {MS:0}{PA:10}I'm not.\nIs that so?{PA:10}||My apologies.\nNowadays,{PA:10} only Yakuza have the kind of||eyes you do... or so I thought.\nBut if you aren't one, that is all and well.{MS:0}{PA:20}||Oh, no... forget it.{PA:20} Farewell."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0213.BIN:65_0_13
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0213.BIN::line:65_0_13"
msgid "Pero si eres uno, está bien. Adiós.{MS:0}{PA:20}||Oh, no...{PA:20} olvídalo."
msgstr ""

