#. y1:english="What's up, {MS:0}{PA:10}old man?\nOh!{PA:10} It's you!{PA:10}\nI witnessed your splendid victory in the||Colosseum.\nThey said \"you proved that you're indeed||a true gangster\",\nbut your fighting style is very in tune||with the martial arts.\nBut you're still a diamond in the rough.{PA:20}\nYou don't completely understand the way of||the warrior.\nIt's a shame indeed.\n...What do you say?{PA:10}||Why don't you become my apprentice?{PA:10}\nYou might become 100 times as strong as you||already are.\nI'm in a hurry.{PA:20} See you later.\nIt's not like I'm forcing you to live and||train with me...\nfor 3 years or anything like that.\nAll you have to do is drop by when you feel||like it. {PA:20}What do you say?\nI told you I'm not interested.\nOh,{PA:10} that's a shame.\nFeel free to stop by when you feel like||you've reached your street fighting limit.\nSounds good.\nOh!{PA:10} So you'll become my apprentice!{PA:10}\nNow you can call yourself \"Komaki's Apprentice\"||from now on!\nHowever...{PA:10} I haven't had an apprentice||for 30 years.{PA:20}\nI think I completely forgot how to train...\nWait a second...\nHmmm... Okay!{PA:10} I'll tell you what!{PA:10}||For starters, I'll show you the basics.\n"
