#. y1:english="Sir!{PA:10} Sir,{PA:10}||is that you?!\nHuh?{PA:10} Who're you?\nIt's...{PA:20} It's me...\nAre you...{PA:20} Tamura?\nYes!{PA:10} Oh,{PA:10}||it's been so long!!\nI thought you were dead.\nHeh...{PA:10} I'm ashamed to say,{PA:10}||but I guess that's what everyone thinks.\nWho told you? Aoki?\nYeah, {PA:20}he told me that you were||trying to dig up info on my case\nand that you ended up in Tokyo Bay...\nHehehe...{PA:10} I'm amazed at Kage's work.{PA:20}||What a perfect cover up!\nWhat do you mean?\nTo tell you the truth,{PA:10} about 5 years ago,{PA:10}||I went to Purgatory to meet Kage.\n...And I realised that I was nowhere||near him as an informant.\nSo I decided to \"disappear\" so||I could work under him.\nWhy did you fake your death?\nWell, {PA:10}you know,{PA:10} I don't have a wife||or kids. {PA:10}I wasn't really missed.\nSo I thought it'd be easier to gather info,{PA:10}||if I didn't exist.\nSo I asked Kage to do me a favour.\nI see.{PA:20} But Aoki's been looking||for you ever since you disappeared.\nReally...{PA:20} But sir,{PA:10}||you can't tell Aoki.\nPlease!\nOkay...{PA:20} I got it.\nSee you later."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0213.BIN:100_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0213.BIN::line:100_0_0"
msgid "iSeñor!{PA:10}||Señor,i¿Es usted?!"
msgstr ""

